<BaseLayout
  title="Founder Branding vs. Product Branding | Draft Topic | Emon Hossain"
  description="A draft topic from Emon Hossain on separating personal reputation, company identity and evidence-backed business claims."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding:4rem 1.5rem;max-width:42rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">DRAFT TOPIC · BRAND SYSTEMS</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:1rem;">Founder Branding vs. Product Branding</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:.95rem;margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.75;">The planned article will explore how a founder's reputation can support a company without turning every company claim, customer result or institutional role into a personal claim.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:2rem;padding:1.25rem;background:white;border:1px solid var(--brand-stone-200);border-radius:1rem;">
      <p style="color:var(--brand-stone-500);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.7;">This is a pre-publication topic page. The final article will be published only after the examples and claims used in it are ready for public use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
